      "type": "html",
      "content": "<!-- Team Section — a four-up bio grid -->\n<section class=\"w-full bg-white px-6 py-24 dark:bg-neutral-950\">\n  <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-5xl\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-lg text-center\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-[34px] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em] text-foreground dark:text-gray-100\">\n        The people behind the pipeline\n      </h2>\n      <p class=\"mt-4 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground dark:text-muted-foreground\">\n        Fourteen engineers, three time zones, one on-call rotation nobody dreads.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-2 gap-8 md:grid-cols-4\">\n      <div class=\"text-center\">\n        <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/160?img=5\" alt=\"Elena Koch\" class=\"mx-auto h-20 w-20 rounded-full object-cover\" />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3.5 text-[14.5px] font-semibold text-foreground dark:text-gray-100\">Elena Koch</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-[12.5px] text-muted-foreground dark:text-muted-foreground\">Co-founder, CEO</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"text-center\">\n        <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/160?img=59\" alt=\"Theo Baptiste\" class=\"mx-auto h-20 w-20 rounded-full object-cover\" />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3.5 text-[14.5px] font-semibold text-foreground dark:text-gray-100\">Theo Baptiste</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-[12.5px] text-muted-foreground dark:text-muted-foreground\">Co-founder, CTO</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"text-center\">\n        <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/160?img=16\" alt=\"Marta Ruiz\" class=\"mx-auto h-20 w-20 rounded-full object-cover\" />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3.5 text-[14.5px] font-semibold text-foreground dark:text-gray-100\">Marta Ruiz</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-[12.5px] text-muted-foreground dark:text-muted-foreground\">Staff Engineer</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"text-center\">\n        <img src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/160?img=45\" alt=\"Priya Anand\" class=\"mx-auto h-20 w-20 rounded-full object-cover\" />\n        <h3 class=\"mt-3.5 text-[14.5px] font-semibold text-foreground dark:text-gray-100\">Priya Anand</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-[12.5px] text-muted-foreground dark:text-muted-foreground\">Design Engineering</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n"
